                <l xml:id="m-fcbe75c3-29f9-4e00-8824-66638f3de7d5" facs="#m-01e29079-e160-4514-9552-d82e83ef7f24" label="ambiguous">814</l><l xml:id="m-65599325-fe68-49b8-aedd-f94b1ace0f1e" facs="#m-d423356b-bc0d-496a-ba89-91fc03f9b648" label="text-like">Quinquagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-339c14da-44dc-4910-abe0-63ae174920c1" facs="#m-d9e1ee14-ed05-4be2-b382-6dd8301ffc3a" label="lyrics-like">V. Sci-tó-te quod Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c72b5fe-607f-4d94-b5ac-7c9976b126da" facs="#m-f69e0372-39ae-490a-8bd0-842af5708fb6" label="ambiguous">in exsul- ta-ti- 6-ne.</l><l xml:id="m-41e7748b-8aca-48d8-abca-f4132c390c30" facs="#m-e0ca7b10-bda6-473b-b21b-49aa36d9bbf7" label="lyrics-like">1- pse est Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4eb40d1-e1da-40b1-beee-34bc7961ca45" facs="#m-5f5b3457-f85c-4d01-bd01-1d17925ecae4" label="ambiguous">mi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-a5de7888-bd70-43d4-a6ad-fba639653501" facs="#m-7972d563-9490-497f-bcc4-b777dee93041" label="ambiguous">us.</l><l xml:id="m-a0b67d26-21e8-467e-be5d-1f99c318c233" facs="#m-4f68f935-9cc4-47cc-8752-48b871a30dcc" label="lyrics-like">V.I- pse fé¬ cit nos, et non i-psi nos:</l><l xml:id="m-d81f3ab4-32c2-4936-9a02-dc789dfaacfe" facs="#m-afda5f8d-8469-490a-aaeb-bf04913d435a" label="lyrics-like">é- jus,</l><l xml:id="m-53718e67-20d9-4142-8fa7-7edb28eb47b0" facs="#m-9d9604e3-a401-4cdd-a8a8-671f8dbb3d81" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-155a6169-c4b7-448b-9ed8-b77737b9bc5f" facs="#m-38669741-b4ed-41c7-a605-f9efc8447900" label="lyrics-like">nos autem pó-pulus</l><l xml:id="m-440af9c0-e43d-45f0-8d5f-acdc6f3b46b5" facs="#m-57b75f0e-7b58-41a5-ad18-87109401236f" label="lyrics-like">óves pá-scu¬ ae éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-11d423a7-266b-4b9e-bc29-8abeaaa0bc55" facs="#m-892bc522-d688-46a8-9ea1-48d000e0632b" label="ambiguous">F Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 18.f.</l><l xml:id="m-038e07ae-09e0-4330-b001-bd4f5cfca39a" facs="#m-e0a525ac-6665-43c1-b0d7-9b0a7e3eb06c" label="lyrics-like">(N illo témpore: Assúmpsit Jesus rogábat quid hoc esset? Dixérunt</l><l xml:id="m-575d9fb1-0090-4d43-9002-05d5d638f971" facs="#m-75a26df5-59ae-4b2b-88c8-c3e07833d3f9" label="lyrics-like">Lduódecim, et ait illis: Ecce ascén¬</l><l xml:id="m-159c4318-8abb-4d11-af2c-8a53dd896b3f" facs="#m-9cb1dfed-870d-4ad0-b7ce-66a5a3c819b9" label="lyrics-like">autem ei, quod Jesus Nazarénus</l><l xml:id="m-8b480f8c-4d7f-41b2-8fe1-9626f67a3189" facs="#m-ea494836-9ed3-4393-a93c-d4783705df03" label="lyrics-like">dimus Jerosólymam, et consumma¬</l><l xml:id="m-367f481b-3f6f-47cc-b87a-11c81d9a7049" facs="#m-5c247df0-6fab-4989-a24d-1316520a1776" label="lyrics-like">transiret. Et clamávit dicens: Jesu,</l><l xml:id="m-c9a45704-5a34-4832-bb08-f59b380395fb" facs="#m-a38cdf72-006f-4d72-9d3e-b1180d436fcc" label="lyrics-like">fili David, miserére mei. Et qui</l><l xml:id="m-740cd317-0ec1-4d4a-973c-3e5d31394024" facs="#m-04e08001-8cef-4a1d-9381-c579a4bf7987" label="lyrics-like">búntur ómnia, quae scripta sunt per</l><l xml:id="m-0a748df4-33e8-4257-865b-8e17d789b79f" facs="#m-59b3cc7d-e6da-4704-b142-73187fa264df" label="lyrics-like">prophétas de Fllio hóminis. Tradé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9e534ed-07cd-4199-9cbe-4b50d671ac0f" facs="#m-815b3578-793f-48f2-8fb2-31920f803c39" label="lyrics-like">praesbant, increpábant eum ut ta¬</l><l xml:id="m-939d4632-19bb-4ce2-97a8-8a747517e3b1" facs="#m-e106bb9d-11e0-4da8-8dff-c4362451d7fd" label="lyrics-like">tur enim géntibus, et illudétur, et</l><l xml:id="m-66d68b27-1195-4975-a256-88af184db32e" facs="#m-922435f4-b587-4225-b373-fee3fd40557a" label="lyrics-like">céret. Ipse vero multo magis cla¬</l><l xml:id="m-4523b639-54d8-4999-9eec-02621d8f82c2" facs="#m-980fa154-cfcb-4fa8-9b4f-68b98a80f62c" label="lyrics-like">mábat: Fili David, miserére mei¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b899b13-a77b-4bf9-b0f0-1705a67effc1" facs="#m-e6d43889-f3b9-4add-b0bf-4a822c3f839e" label="lyrics-like">flagellábitur, et conspuétur : et post¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9bb07e9-daf0-4f4d-8000-1af787193f9d" facs="#m-9f84ecb4-9cd0-4ac0-8f26-b7261b48ef21" label="lyrics-like">quam flagelláverint, occident eum,</l><l xml:id="m-b52f58f8-e763-4559-8500-1923b4a8c2ff" facs="#m-5a5a2a83-4f33-48ea-9589-c126e16d84c6" label="ambiguous">Stans autem Jesus, jussit illum ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-fbc4000f-8229-471b-8de1-689c6f702cd3" facs="#m-9bac4003-86b2-4523-945e-dbf3a44cc43f" label="lyrics-like">dúci ad se. Et cum appropinquásset,</l><l xml:id="m-9b2d23d8-6997-4c88-b92b-8d54bffbd06c" facs="#m-19d6694f-4c9e-44f7-91ff-a5cc0b9f2118" label="lyrics-like">et tértia die resúrget. Et ipsi nihii</l><l xml:id="m-1ff34512-18e1-44bd-95bf-d08c54abcd59" facs="#m-27c5d619-3123-42c5-85a4-198215707b3e" label="lyrics-like">horum intellexérunt, et erat verbum</l><l xml:id="m-1e2c7c27-103b-42ad-8f4c-6917d4c3b826" facs="#m-55ea9a86-ae5f-4760-804b-7e5a7213687f" label="lyrics-like">interrogávit illum, dicens : Quid tibi</l><l xml:id="m-c4dd237a-6b7f-41f9-8e9e-abafd761014f" facs="#m-afc27f58-78f0-4e55-8fae-4f5f0e2f7500" label="lyrics-like">istud abscónditum ab eis, et non</l><l xml:id="m-cd7f57a5-e44c-4a3e-9157-a45172ea92b4" facs="#m-cdfa1c2b-9d9f-468c-9b8b-9d8a04cb7886" label="lyrics-like">vis fáciam? At ille dixit: Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-7e40f650-f2af-4acc-bb53-b48eb9d64314" facs="#m-1e3a79d8-5351-48a3-b86a-8b55c68600d6" label="lyrics-like">intelligébant quae dicebántur. Fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-9cbf794d-a84c-48b6-9e06-a7da5663071e" facs="#m-5f27aa26-f6c3-4599-9650-c0c631400f18" label="lyrics-like">ut videam. Et Jesus dixit illi : Ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff3cda24-7e5b-4d27-b6c8-9200ed81292b" facs="#m-73ef44c9-ae14-4bff-bcbd-a3ffc01a4330" label="lyrics-like">ctum est autem, cum appropinquá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4b73a09-41d1-49c6-b7eb-46fbf6a6fd45" facs="#m-37ddb33e-f00b-487a-a0c0-9277ea096382" label="ambiguous">spice, fides tua te salvum fecit. Et</l><l xml:id="m-a2f06c6f-228f-466e-921f-6d1d93beab21" facs="#m-cccfe0df-b3f1-43c0-9cf5-9369058c7060" label="lyrics-like">conféstim vidit, et sequebátur illum,</l><l xml:id="m-94b7a90a-4337-421a-a662-802d631e5357" facs="#m-2a34896d-0bc9-4223-8f6e-526cfe6e5a52" label="lyrics-like">ret Jéricho, caecus quidam sedébat</l><l xml:id="m-267d1b0c-973b-4736-a7f1-4f5a6a8cf4e2" facs="#m-19e81ff9-da6c-484c-9aa2-bf97b26013f0" label="lyrics-like">secus viam, mendícans. Et cum au¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8d7f8da-c934-4b4a-b8ed-c33aed6e547c" facs="#m-89304939-9b89-4531-99af-589d3c24115c" label="lyrics-like">magníficans Deum. Et omnis plebs</l><l xml:id="m-e457ca74-ba7d-492f-b1d5-6544a32c6779" facs="#m-f8798fa3-b939-4747-827c-686716f92a2c" label="lyrics-like">diret turbam praetereúntem, inter-lut vidit, dedit laudem Deo. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-f8dc749d-8f8d-487d-8b2c-045ac58d7b1f" facs="#m-d29b3ebc-c007-40a2-992a-52e4e98e7f7c" label="ambiguous">orert.F–</l><l xml:id="m-32f02ad4-5836-4526-8dd1-3be2634030ff" facs="#m-8f14f6d6-38e6-4e80-bf15-9850dab088b8" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-90ae6581-9bc5-4780-8a2d-23ff3bf31063" facs="#m-a1068bd6-3b30-421c-8666-bceb17d0103d" label="lyrics-like">DEnedí-tus es “Dómi- ne, dó-ce me justi¬ f</l><l xml:id="m-09f5f37e-c6ef-4931-97b1-5138f8ae20d2" facs="#m-b1639a73-445a-4ad8-a94d-03e00a45aed8" label="lyrics-like">ca-ti-6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-425de0c6-0ed4-474b-b3b1-5f599718f7a1" facs="#m-1837b126-2f7c-492b-9f14-656f29a7e660" label="lyrics-like">as: benedí-ctus es Dómi¬ ne,</l><l xml:id="m-bb88b607-eb2f-4bc2-bf3d-177a56fc8468" facs="#m-2ae18d70-7f49-4c95-b719-24c722a6b1aa" label="lyrics-like">nes tú¬</l></lg>
            </div>
